/workspace/gemma4/refs/notebooks/gemma-4-the-complete-guide-expanded/gemma-4-the-complete-guide-expanded.txt:1505:**Research.** Jimenez et al., SWE-bench, ICLR 2024 ([arXiv:2310.06770](https://arxiv.org/abs/2310.06770)). OpenAI, [Introducing SWE-bench Verified](https://openai.com/index/introducing-swe-bench-verified/), 2024. Yao et al., ReAct, ICLR 2023 ([arXiv:2210.03629](https://arxiv.org/abs/2210.03629)). Yang et al., SWE-agent, NeurIPS 2024 ([arXiv:2405.15793](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.15793)). Wang et al., OpenHands, ICLR 2025 ([arXiv:2407.16741](https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.16741)). Xia et al., Agentless, 2024 ([arXiv:2407.01489](https://arxiv.org/abs/2407.01489)). Zhang et al., AutoCodeRover, ISSTA 2024 ([arXiv:2404.05427](https://arxiv.org/abs/2404.05427)). Ouyang et al., RepoGraph, ICLR 2025 ([arXiv:2410.14684](https://arxiv.org/abs/2410.14684)). Liu et al., Lost in the Middle, TACL 2024 ([arXiv:2307.03172](https://arxiv.org/abs/2307.03172)). Kwon et al., PagedAttention / vLLM, SOSP 2023 ([arXiv:2309.06180](https://arxiv.org/abs/2309.06180)). Hu et al., LoRA, 2021 ([arXiv:2106.09685](https://arxiv.org/abs/2106.09685)). Pan et al., SWE-Gym, ICML 2025 ([arXiv:2412.21139](https://arxiv.org/abs/2412.21139)). Yang et al., SWE-smith, 2025 ([arXiv:2504.21798](https://arxiv.org/abs/2504.21798)). Wei et al., SWE-RL, 2025 ([arXiv:2502.18449](https://arxiv.org/abs/2502.18449)). Shao et al., DeepSeekMath (GRPO), 2024 ([arXiv:2402.03300](https://arxiv.org/abs/2402.03300)). Chen et al., Codex / pass@k, 2021 ([arXiv:2107.03374](https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.03374)). Ethayarajh, How Contextual are Contextualized Word Representations?, EMNLP 2019 ([arXiv:1909.00512](https://arxiv.org/abs/1909.00512)). Gemma Team, Gemma 4 Technical Report, 2026 ([arXiv:2607.02770](https://arxiv.org/abs/2607.02770)); model card [google/gemma-4-31B-it](https://huggingface.co/google/gemma-4-31B-it).
